    "summary": "**Daemonic Illusions (Aura**) — A friendly **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit protects a visible friendly **PSYKER** from the **THOUSAND SONS** within 6″. For incoming ranged attacks, it saves on a 4+ invulnerable save. **Mortal Sorcery (Aura**) — A friendly **THOUSAND SONS** unit confers [Cabal of Sorcerers](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.cabal-of-sorcerers) on friendly **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS PSYKER** units it sees within 6″.",
